# text = The tall man leaped over , just there ; and the Jew , running a few paces to the right , crept through that gap This is strange Strange Blathers and Duff , themselves , could make nothing of it A few -- a very few -- will suffice , Rose What I shall have to say , has already presented itself to your mind ; the most cherished hopes of my heart are not unknown to you , though from my lips you have not heard them stated I -- I -- ought to have left here , before You should , indeed Forgive me for saying so , but I wish you had I was brought here , by the most dreadful and agonising of all apprehensions the fear of losing the one dear being on whom my every wish and hope are fixed .
