# text = If you repeat this information to a gentleman whom I can summon in an instant from the next room , you can be consigned to some place of safety without half an hour's delay I wish to go back I must go back , because -- how can I tell such things to an innocent lady like you ?-- because among the men I have told you of , there is one : the most desperate among them all ; that I can't leave : no , not even to be saved from the life I am leading now Your having interfered in this dear boy's behalf before your coming here , at so great a risk , to tell me what you have heard ; your manner , which convinces me of the truth of what you say ; your evident contrition , and sense of shame ; all lead me to believe that you might yet be reclaimed .
