# text = He was worn by anxiety and remorse almost to a shadow ; talked in a wild , distracted way , of ruin and dishonour worked by himself ; confided to me his intention to convert his whole property , at any loss , into money , and , having settled on his wife and you a portion of his recent acquisition , to fly the country -- I guessed too well he would not fly alone -- and never see it more .
